# 📦 2. AI CONTRACT (ZORUNLU)

## Kabul edilen TEK format

```json
{
  "intent": "string",
  "risk_level": "low | medium | high",
  "patch": {
    "file": "string",
    "operations": [
      {
        "search": "string",
        "replace": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "confidence": "number (0-1)"
}
```

---

## Kurallar

* eksik alan → ❌ REJECT
* boş operations → ❌ REJECT
* search bulunamaz → ❌ REJECT

---

# 🔍 3. VALIDATION LAYER

## Fonksiyon

```js
function validate(input) {
  if (!input.intent) throw "INVALID_INTENT"
  if (!input.risk_level) throw "NO_RISK"
  if (!input.patch) throw "NO_PATCH"
  if (!input.patch.file) throw "NO_FILE"
  if (!input.patch.operations.length) throw "EMPTY_PATCH"
}
```

---

# 🔧 4. BRIDGE SPEC (CORE)

## 4.1 applyPatch (dry-run)

```js
function applyPatch(original, operations) {
  let updated = original

  for (const op of operations) {
    if (!updated.includes(op.search)) {
      throw "SEARCH_NOT_FOUND"
    }
    updated = updated.replace(op.search, op.replace)
  }

  return updated
}
```

---

## 4.2 Diff üretimi

```js
function generateDiff(before, after) {
  return {
    before,
    after
  }
}
```

---

## 4.3 Apply (gerçek yazma)

```js
writeFile(file, updated)
```

---

## 4.4 Rollback

```js
writeFile(file, original)
```

---

# ⚙️ 5. EXECUTION GATE

## Akış

```js
original = readFile(file)

updated = applyPatch(original, ops)   // dry-run

diff = generateDiff(original, updated)

print(diff)

if (user !== "y") exit()

try {
  writeFile(file, updated)
} catch (e) {
  writeFile(file, original)
  throw "ROLLBACK_DONE"
}
```

